WEBVTT

01:41.610 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.670 --> 01:48.990
[Episode 4]

02:16.680 --> 02:17.560
[Eternal Sect]

02:17.820 --> 02:19.370
[The dungeon of Eternal Sect]

02:25.280 --> 02:26.000
Tell me!

02:26.470 --> 02:27.280
What's your name?

02:27.750 --> 02:29.000
Who ordered you to come to

02:29.400 --> 02:30.470
Mount Eternal in disguise?

02:40.000 --> 02:40.750
Tell me!

02:40.770 --> 02:41.420
Tell me!

02:41.570 --> 02:42.220
Tell me!

02:48.030 --> 02:49.710
Take him to the Exorcising Tower tomorrow.

02:50.079 --> 02:51.120
Let the sovereign interrogate him!

02:51.360 --> 02:51.910
Yes!

02:53.000 --> 02:54.190
You're so tough.

02:54.750 --> 02:56.030
I really wonder who you are.

03:09.010 --> 03:11.510
[Prince Zong's residence]

03:11.910 --> 03:12.590
Brother.

03:13.470 --> 03:14.520
Brother!

03:15.680 --> 03:17.000
Alright, stop crying.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.740
Thank you, Master Mu,

03:19.770 --> 03:20.730
for stepping in

03:21.030 --> 03:22.910
and saving my son's life.

03:23.960 --> 03:26.040
You've done us a great favor.

03:26.120 --> 03:29.210
I truly don't know how to repay such kindness.

03:30.630 --> 03:31.870
I just returned Yu's favor.

03:32.310 --> 03:33.079
It's no big deal.

03:33.840 --> 03:34.470
Miss,

03:34.750 --> 03:35.690
you're so good.

03:36.030 --> 03:36.840
Brother,

03:36.840 --> 03:37.680
you should marry

03:37.680 --> 03:38.750
Miss Mu soon.

03:41.800 --> 03:42.960
Master Mu, please forgive him.

03:43.630 --> 03:45.220
My son's just a little boy.

03:45.360 --> 03:46.630
He spoke out of turn.

03:47.590 --> 03:48.520
He's just a kid.

03:50.400 --> 03:50.960
Maids.

03:51.620 --> 03:52.690
Take them both

03:52.910 --> 03:53.910
inside to rest.

03:55.000 --> 03:56.030
Have a good rest.

04:05.280 --> 04:06.000
Qingge.

04:08.470 --> 04:09.310
Father prepared a banquet

04:09.310 --> 04:10.240
to thank you.

04:10.400 --> 04:11.520
Why are you leaving so soon?

04:12.580 --> 04:13.650
I need to take someone important

04:13.680 --> 04:14.520
as my disciple.

04:14.960 --> 04:15.520
But…

04:15.710 --> 04:16.600
If something comes up,

04:16.630 --> 04:17.480
just go to Mount Wester to find me.

04:21.920 --> 04:22.600
Qingge.

04:23.750 --> 04:25.310
I want to stay in the Imperial City.

04:32.190 --> 04:33.360
You've always loved lively places.

04:33.720 --> 04:35.040
Mount Wester is indeed a bit boring.

04:35.510 --> 04:36.070
Okay.

04:36.500 --> 04:37.340
You can stay.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.510
Take this jade whistle.

04:42.870 --> 04:44.159
If you're in danger, blow it.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.680
I'll come to your aid right away.

04:51.480 --> 04:52.360
Then I'll take my leave.

05:32.040 --> 05:33.950
Are you here to interrogate me, Sovereign?

05:37.630 --> 05:39.630
You've suffered all night.

05:40.720 --> 05:42.040
Have some water first.

06:05.750 --> 06:06.510
Sovereign,

06:06.510 --> 06:07.720
you're showing me mercy.

06:08.160 --> 06:09.920
I already know everything.

06:10.310 --> 06:11.870
No need for further interrogation.

06:16.190 --> 06:17.000
Su Yishui,

06:17.390 --> 06:18.480
how is

06:18.830 --> 06:19.630
Prince Ping doing?

06:20.020 --> 06:20.940
How did you…

06:21.020 --> 06:22.310
You're so talented,

06:22.520 --> 06:24.200
yet you've intentionally hidden your strength.

06:24.390 --> 06:25.920
Every time you left the mountain for training,

06:25.920 --> 06:27.600
you spent a few days in the Imperial City.

06:27.690 --> 06:29.250
You're such a special disciple.

06:29.340 --> 06:30.710
I just needed to pay a bit of attention

06:31.040 --> 06:33.560
to uncover the truth of your identity.

06:33.950 --> 06:34.870
Sovereign,

06:35.370 --> 06:36.220
I did that

06:36.240 --> 06:37.000
only for cultivation.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.830
Heavenly Sects can't get involved in mortal affairs.

06:38.950 --> 06:39.909
They don't accept nobles.

06:40.580 --> 06:41.820
That's why I hid my identity.

06:42.360 --> 06:44.630
At this point,

06:45.000 --> 06:46.159
you don't need

06:46.630 --> 06:47.920
to keep lying.

06:49.870 --> 06:51.830
This is my token as the sovereign.

06:52.560 --> 06:54.360
If you wish to go to the library,

06:54.600 --> 06:56.240
just agree to one thing.

06:57.409 --> 06:59.210
What is it?

06:59.860 --> 07:01.100
As a Heavenly One,

07:01.240 --> 07:02.600
I don't ask for much in life.

07:02.720 --> 07:04.430
Aside from completing cultivation,

07:04.870 --> 07:07.040
all I wish for is a worthy successor.

07:07.900 --> 07:09.670
From the day you came to Mount Eternal,

07:09.920 --> 07:10.980
I've had the intention

07:11.070 --> 07:12.800
to take you as my direct disciple.

07:13.720 --> 07:15.700
Unfortunately, you've hidden too much,

07:16.480 --> 07:18.840
and I couldn't just expose you for no reason.

07:19.390 --> 07:20.510
Now that we've put it on the table,

07:20.930 --> 07:22.110
it's actually a good thing.

07:24.870 --> 07:25.600
Yishui,

07:26.890 --> 07:28.160
if you're willing to kneel down,

07:28.190 --> 07:29.510
drip your blood onto the jade tablet,

07:29.850 --> 07:30.880
and swear a soul oath

07:31.300 --> 07:32.800
that you'll join my sect

07:32.830 --> 07:33.830
and never betray it,

07:34.190 --> 07:34.990
you can

07:35.240 --> 07:36.270
take this token.

07:36.600 --> 07:37.159
From now on,

07:37.220 --> 07:38.860
I'll teach you

07:39.290 --> 07:41.860
all the Heavenly arts I know.

07:42.510 --> 07:43.830
What do you say?

08:02.680 --> 08:04.000
I hereby take a soul oath.

08:04.430 --> 08:05.190
From today on,

08:05.440 --> 08:06.490
I'll join your sect,

08:06.560 --> 08:08.110
focus on cultivation, and never betray it.

08:10.430 --> 08:11.270
Good boy.

08:12.870 --> 08:13.770
You've made the soul oath.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.240
Serve me a cup of tea,

08:15.330 --> 08:16.690
and you'll officially be my disciple.

08:16.870 --> 08:18.210
Don't give up halfway.

08:18.240 --> 08:18.600
You…

08:18.750 --> 08:19.510
You tricked me!

08:20.110 --> 08:20.870
So what?

08:21.070 --> 08:21.870
I'll kill you!

08:23.040 --> 08:24.600
You lost the bet and tried to back out.

08:24.750 --> 08:26.240
I'm just claiming my wager.

08:29.360 --> 08:29.870
Alright.

08:30.680 --> 08:31.700
Hurry up and offer me the tea.

08:32.960 --> 08:33.669
No way!

08:34.520 --> 08:35.990
You'll offer me the tea as my disciple.

08:36.789 --> 08:37.750
There's no escaping it.

08:57.070 --> 08:57.550
Done.

08:58.090 --> 08:58.660
From now on,

08:58.680 --> 08:59.560
you're my disciple.

09:01.630 --> 09:02.260
Shui,

09:02.620 --> 09:03.500
let's go back to Mount Wester.

09:07.840 --> 09:08.800
Don't waste your energy.

09:09.120 --> 09:10.800
Blood in the jade tablet; soul bound to the sect.

09:11.080 --> 09:11.720
It's useless.

09:18.080 --> 09:19.200
The demoness, Mu Qingge!

09:19.270 --> 09:20.360
How dare you break into the prison?

09:21.870 --> 09:23.230
Thank that old man Kaiyuan for me

09:23.390 --> 09:24.080
for giving me

09:24.080 --> 09:25.080
such a good disciple.

09:27.200 --> 09:27.870
Go report to Master!

09:28.080 --> 09:28.480
Yes.

09:32.320 --> 09:33.750
Master, what should we do?

09:36.390 --> 09:37.150
Senior Kaiyuan,

09:37.670 --> 09:39.060
I knew something was wrong.

09:39.400 --> 09:40.520
Su Cheng has always been upright.

09:40.550 --> 09:41.630
How could he suddenly steal books?

09:42.050 --> 09:42.410
It seems

09:42.440 --> 09:43.840
he was forced by that demoness.

09:44.030 --> 09:45.750
We should go to Mount Wester to rescue him right away.

09:46.270 --> 09:47.270
But Su Cheng

09:47.380 --> 09:48.410
has become

09:48.440 --> 09:49.790
Mu Qingge's disciple.

09:50.320 --> 09:51.480
Whether he was forced

09:51.720 --> 09:52.600
or not,

09:52.980 --> 09:55.270
since he's made his choice,

09:55.630 --> 09:57.560
he's no longer an Eternal.

09:58.150 --> 09:59.270
So what reason do I have

09:59.630 --> 10:00.960
to go to Mount Wester and demand him back?

10:01.430 --> 10:02.270
Besides,

10:02.600 --> 10:03.420
he did sneak into

10:03.550 --> 10:05.150
the library,

10:05.390 --> 10:06.390
breaking the sect's rules.

10:06.910 --> 10:07.720
His life and death

10:08.270 --> 10:10.120
are no longer our concern.

10:17.910 --> 10:19.190
This is my Mount Wester.

10:23.360 --> 10:25.270
Master. Master. Master.

10:25.390 --> 10:26.040
Master's back.

10:26.280 --> 10:27.730
Master. Master. Master.

10:28.110 --> 10:29.820
Master, you're finally back!

10:30.360 --> 10:31.790
Why were you gone so long?

10:32.630 --> 10:34.110
You're collecting pretty boys everywhere.

10:34.130 --> 10:35.010
So dissolute.

10:37.080 --> 10:37.750
Master,

10:38.360 --> 10:39.120
who is this?

10:40.000 --> 10:41.360
This is your new fellow disciple,

10:41.910 --> 10:42.550
Su Yishui.

10:43.120 --> 10:43.510
Master,

10:43.810 --> 10:44.690
after being away so long,

10:44.720 --> 10:45.720
you brought back a new disciple.

10:46.360 --> 10:46.750
Come on.

10:47.200 --> 10:48.390
Let us give you a tour.

10:49.350 --> 10:49.920
From now on,

10:50.150 --> 10:50.840
we'll train together

10:51.200 --> 10:51.870
under Master.

10:52.750 --> 10:53.110
Let's go.

10:56.270 --> 10:57.030
Mu Qingge!

10:58.120 --> 10:59.080
You want to hurt people again?

11:00.510 --> 11:01.550
I'll kill whoever dares

11:01.750 --> 11:02.390
to touch me!

11:04.510 --> 11:05.720
I'll seal your power for now.

11:07.390 --> 11:07.840
Zeng Yi.

11:08.030 --> 11:08.480
Yes.

11:09.080 --> 11:09.910
Take him to his room.

11:13.510 --> 11:14.030
Junior Su,

11:14.710 --> 11:15.790
I'm your 14th senior brother.

11:16.390 --> 11:17.000
Come with me.

11:26.370 --> 11:27.550
[Wang Suizhi, Mu Qingge's disciple]

11:27.030 --> 11:27.610
Master.

11:28.080 --> 11:28.670
I

11:29.080 --> 11:30.910
read Junior Su's fortune.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.080
It's not good.

11:33.750 --> 11:34.390
He might even

11:35.480 --> 11:36.240
drag you down.

11:37.390 --> 11:39.030
Suizhi, I know you're good at reading fortunes,

11:39.550 --> 11:40.480
but if I can

11:40.510 --> 11:42.150
keep this talented little brat

11:42.270 --> 11:43.480
here in Mount Wester,

11:44.630 --> 11:45.550
wouldn't it make me

11:45.550 --> 11:46.390
look impressive?

11:49.850 --> 11:53.720
[Carefree Pavilion]

12:03.670 --> 12:04.320
Well,

12:04.510 --> 12:05.480
Master said

12:05.560 --> 12:06.520
you've suffered internal injuries

12:06.670 --> 12:07.630
which caused a lot of stagnant blood.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.920
She wants you to take those medicines

12:10.030 --> 12:11.080
and then take a herbal bath.

12:16.910 --> 12:17.440
Get lost!

12:42.080 --> 12:43.450
I've been waiting for a long time.

12:43.610 --> 12:45.140
Turns out you still haven't cleaned yourself up.

12:45.450 --> 12:46.260
You vicious demoness,

12:46.300 --> 12:47.330
I won't give in to you!

12:48.080 --> 12:49.720
So you know I'm a demoness.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.280
Then why aren't you behaving?

12:55.510 --> 12:56.480
Just kill me already!

13:02.390 --> 13:03.720
You're so handsome.

13:03.970 --> 13:05.160
It would be a shame to kill you.

13:05.960 --> 13:07.550
I'd rather keep you around just to look at.

13:15.030 --> 13:15.670
Good.

13:17.390 --> 13:18.030
This way,

13:18.720 --> 13:19.960
I can see clearly

13:20.750 --> 13:21.910
and get things done.

13:28.200 --> 13:28.670
I knew it.

13:28.670 --> 13:30.270
The Eternals tortured you,

13:30.480 --> 13:31.510
but the wounds should be external

13:32.000 --> 13:33.320
instead of internal.

13:34.000 --> 13:35.440
So it's the Bone-Eroding Fire.

13:36.440 --> 13:37.510
Is it a punishment from Prince Ping?

13:39.440 --> 13:40.030
Your face is so cold

13:40.030 --> 13:41.440
it's practically frozen,

13:41.870 --> 13:43.320
but there's still a trace of warmth inside.

13:43.750 --> 13:45.150
You locked Second Young Master up and didn't kill him.

13:45.430 --> 13:46.700
No wonder Prince Ping punished you.

13:50.170 --> 13:51.030
Who are you?

13:51.400 --> 13:52.520
Please don't kill me!

13:52.550 --> 13:53.720
Sir, I beg you.

13:54.390 --> 13:55.480
Don't come any closer.

13:56.600 --> 13:57.520
I have longan.

13:57.550 --> 13:59.080
Please, don't kill me. I beg you.

13:59.360 --> 14:00.510
I'll give you all of it. Look.

14:05.000 --> 14:05.950
Dried longan!

14:08.240 --> 14:10.200
It's really tasty. I'll give you all of it.

14:10.200 --> 14:12.600
Please don't kill me, okay?

14:13.670 --> 14:14.120
Get up.

14:14.270 --> 14:14.840
Come with me.

14:20.870 --> 14:23.200
I sent you to Eternal Sect to learn immortal arts.

14:24.150 --> 14:26.440
I told you to kill a kid, yet you lost him.

14:40.900 --> 14:41.610
Yishui.

14:43.160 --> 14:45.710
Whether what you said is true or not doesn't matter,

14:46.390 --> 14:48.630
but there's one thing you need to remember:

14:49.390 --> 14:51.730
if you can't carry out

14:51.850 --> 14:53.060
my orders,

14:54.440 --> 14:56.360
you'll wish you were dead.

15:05.750 --> 15:06.720
Young Master,

15:07.620 --> 15:08.790
sorry for the offense.

15:35.150 --> 15:36.000
Am I right?

15:37.910 --> 15:38.600
It's none of your business.

15:39.130 --> 15:40.440
I helped you force the boiling blood out,

15:40.720 --> 15:41.550
yet you're still so rude.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.040
Take your clothes off.

15:49.260 --> 15:50.040
Get changed.

15:50.450 --> 15:51.330
Do you want to live here

15:51.360 --> 15:52.220
covered in blood?

16:11.630 --> 16:13.030
Stop looking at me like that.

16:13.960 --> 16:14.870
You really think my disciples

16:14.890 --> 16:15.700
are all my toy boys?

16:16.280 --> 16:17.320
They're your disciples,

16:17.350 --> 16:18.350
but none of them are powerful.

16:19.030 --> 16:20.030
If they aren't toy boys, what are they?

16:22.360 --> 16:23.480
Lyu Yuan excels in music.

16:23.910 --> 16:25.320
Jiang Huaimu loves plants.

16:26.030 --> 16:27.870
Wang Suizhi can read fortunes.

16:28.340 --> 16:30.050
Zeng Yi loves crafting magical tools.

16:31.200 --> 16:32.600
Each of my disciples

16:32.630 --> 16:33.790
has their own unique talent,

16:34.150 --> 16:35.320
but none are skilled in martial arts.

16:36.080 --> 16:37.360
In other Heavenly Sects,

16:37.670 --> 16:38.790
they'd be considered losers.

16:39.720 --> 16:40.600
What a waste that would be.

16:41.440 --> 16:43.030
I brought them to Mount Wester

16:43.390 --> 16:44.360
and got a group

16:44.390 --> 16:45.670
of interesting disciples.

16:47.030 --> 16:48.320
Stop justifying yourself.

16:48.790 --> 16:49.600
You received them

16:49.630 --> 16:50.630
only because they're good-looking.

16:51.240 --> 16:52.670
Once they become my disciples,

16:53.120 --> 16:54.910
even if they cause a huge disaster,

16:55.150 --> 16:56.390
I'll take responsibility for them.

16:57.120 --> 16:59.220
So what's wrong with me

16:59.670 --> 17:00.750
picking the pretty ones?

17:06.030 --> 17:07.210
So everything you did before

17:07.420 --> 17:08.420
was just to toy with me?

17:10.109 --> 17:10.880
Shui.

17:12.109 --> 17:13.550
Everything you did

17:14.109 --> 17:15.640
was arranged by Prince Ping,

17:17.440 --> 17:18.030
right?

17:22.000 --> 17:23.200
You're so talented.

17:23.960 --> 17:25.750
Why settle to be a pawn?

17:26.920 --> 17:28.069
Don't you think it's a waste?

17:31.680 --> 17:33.030
How do you know I'm the pawn

17:33.550 --> 17:34.640
and not the mastermind?

17:37.230 --> 17:38.010
Before I become

17:38.030 --> 17:39.070
the strongest,

17:39.830 --> 17:40.750
there's always no choice.

17:42.590 --> 17:43.480
But one day,

17:44.310 --> 17:44.890
I'll hold them

17:44.920 --> 17:46.110
tightly in my hands.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.400
The obsession with becoming the strongest

17:48.750 --> 17:50.110
will only bind you with desire.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.350
In the end,

17:51.720 --> 17:53.200
you won't even be able to control yourself.

17:54.790 --> 17:55.440
That way,

17:56.310 --> 17:57.640
you'll lose yourself easily.

17:59.680 --> 18:00.400
Don't lecture me

18:00.400 --> 18:01.240
with pointless words.

18:01.880 --> 18:02.480
Tell me.

18:02.830 --> 18:03.750
Why do you insist on

18:03.780 --> 18:04.580
taking me as your disciple?

18:05.030 --> 18:06.200
Because for all these years,

18:06.490 --> 18:07.560
you're the only one I've encountered

18:07.590 --> 18:08.480
with the Five Spirit Roots.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.830
You're the most suitable to be my successor.

18:12.000 --> 18:12.680
Second,

18:13.590 --> 18:14.700
you have too much bloodlust.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.520
If I hadn't met you, you could just stay that way.

18:16.800 --> 18:17.690
But since I've met you,

18:17.720 --> 18:19.000
I have to teach you properly.

18:19.840 --> 18:21.040
If I leave you unchecked,

18:21.200 --> 18:22.720
you'll end up killing indiscriminately

18:22.750 --> 18:23.640
and wreaking havoc.

18:25.450 --> 18:26.640
I've made it quite clear, haven't I?

18:27.930 --> 18:28.930
Then let's see how long you can trap me

18:28.960 --> 18:29.830
in Mount Wester.

18:30.790 --> 18:31.680
I'll kill those

18:32.030 --> 18:33.000
I want to kill sooner or later.

18:34.270 --> 18:35.000
I see.

18:35.960 --> 18:36.590
That's easy.

18:38.640 --> 18:40.160
I, Mu Qingge, sovereign of Wester Sect,

18:40.500 --> 18:41.850
free my disciple, Su Yishui,

18:41.880 --> 18:42.720
from power restraints

18:43.200 --> 18:44.050
and the constraints

18:44.070 --> 18:45.440
of the jade tablet.

18:45.790 --> 18:46.960
He can try to take my life.

18:58.790 --> 18:59.720
You want me to kill you?

19:00.530 --> 19:02.060
Since you're so eager to kill,

19:02.510 --> 19:04.240
then I'll bear that killing intent.

19:04.830 --> 19:05.870
From now on,

19:06.090 --> 19:06.660
you can use

19:06.680 --> 19:07.830
all kinds of methods to kill me.

19:08.310 --> 19:09.240
If you're not powerful enough

19:09.640 --> 19:10.590
or lack skills,

19:11.160 --> 19:11.920
I'll teach you.

19:12.240 --> 19:13.880
As long as you kill me, your master,

19:14.310 --> 19:15.640
you can break the soul oath

19:15.880 --> 19:16.960
and leave Mount Wester.

19:20.070 --> 19:20.830
Don't regret it!

19:45.200 --> 19:46.210
Your sword moves are too direct.

19:48.990 --> 19:50.220
Trying to kill me has a price.

19:50.830 --> 19:51.680
Every failed attempt

19:51.830 --> 19:53.240
comes with a punishment.

20:28.070 --> 20:29.590
Killing me by injuring yourself?

20:29.830 --> 20:30.720
Do you have a death wish?

20:33.960 --> 20:35.030
I just want to kill you.

20:35.400 --> 20:36.200
You brat,

20:36.880 --> 20:37.810
you're cruel to others,

20:37.880 --> 20:38.750
but even more so to yourself.

20:39.790 --> 20:40.680
You need a different punishment.

20:50.030 --> 20:50.880
What do you mean?

20:52.640 --> 20:53.550
Play the qin for me.

20:55.390 --> 20:56.520
What kind of punishment is this?

20:57.380 --> 20:58.470
It's nothing for others,

20:58.750 --> 21:00.240
but for you, it's a heavy punishment.

21:01.510 --> 21:02.060
I won't play.

21:02.550 --> 21:03.860
Then I'll take your sword.

21:04.240 --> 21:05.750
From now on, you can only play the qin.

21:07.720 --> 21:09.440
Being a qin player wouldn't be so bad.

21:17.610 --> 21:19.340
This piece is called "Drunk Breeze."

21:19.890 --> 21:20.650
Learn it for me.

21:39.080 --> 21:40.460
It's a beautiful melody,

21:40.750 --> 21:42.480
but you're playing it like a war song

21:42.480 --> 21:43.840
that's full of blood and killing.

21:44.400 --> 21:45.750
Your temperament needs improving.

21:47.070 --> 21:47.750
Come with me.

22:00.440 --> 22:01.180
Mu Qingge.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.750
What exactly do you want to do?

22:04.200 --> 22:05.590
Killing intent needs to be suppressed.

22:05.940 --> 22:06.910
Take care of

22:07.000 --> 22:08.070
these little things.

22:08.720 --> 22:09.530
If they lose one hair,

22:09.780 --> 22:10.730
you'll play ten more qin pieces.

22:42.880 --> 22:43.940
Is Junior Su

22:44.240 --> 22:45.590
really going to play the qin all night?

23:01.830 --> 23:02.880
He fed the rabbits and chickens

23:03.200 --> 23:04.160
and played the qin all night.

23:04.790 --> 23:05.440
Don't mess with him.

23:25.440 --> 23:26.960
I made some sweets just for you.

23:27.960 --> 23:28.890
I saw that you had

23:28.920 --> 23:30.080
sea salt dried longan in your bag,

23:30.240 --> 23:31.160
so I thought you might like it.

23:31.590 --> 23:32.720
I tried making some for you.

23:33.200 --> 23:33.910
Since you came here,

23:33.930 --> 23:35.120
you've been beaten up seven times.

23:35.270 --> 23:36.030
Here,

23:36.550 --> 23:37.480
seven pieces as compensation.

23:44.400 --> 23:44.770
Go ahead.

23:44.990 --> 23:45.510
Try them.

23:49.830 --> 23:50.400
What?

23:50.960 --> 23:51.620
They're that bad?

23:52.110 --> 23:53.440
I swear, I'll kill you!

24:05.060 --> 24:07.220
[Uncle Ye Xin's residence, Puxin Village]

24:06.960 --> 24:07.510
Qingge.

24:07.960 --> 24:09.280
You promised to come back every three months

24:09.310 --> 24:10.200
to visit Uncle Ye Xin.

24:10.510 --> 24:11.480
You were almost late.

24:11.830 --> 24:13.000
But didn't I make it just in time?

24:13.310 --> 24:14.000
Where's Uncle Ye Xin?

24:14.480 --> 24:15.720
Being late doesn't matter.

24:16.000 --> 24:16.830
I'm happy enough

24:16.920 --> 24:18.550
that you still remember me.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.140
Chestnut cakes!

24:26.310 --> 24:26.960
Years ago,

24:26.960 --> 24:28.580
when I found you by the roadside,

24:28.720 --> 24:29.950
you were both hungry

24:29.010 --> 24:29.820
[Ye Xin, a cultivator]

24:30.240 --> 24:31.170
and crying.

24:31.510 --> 24:32.590
So many years have passed.

24:33.000 --> 24:33.640
I can't believe

24:33.920 --> 24:35.030
you've grown up so much.

24:38.590 --> 24:39.110
Qingge,

24:39.550 --> 24:40.680
I heard you took on a disciple.

24:41.030 --> 24:42.150
What kind of person is he?

24:42.350 --> 24:43.550
The youngest son of Prince Ping,

24:43.830 --> 24:44.720
a rebellious lad.

24:45.350 --> 24:47.010
I heard he's tough.

24:47.640 --> 24:48.790
How do you plan to train him?

24:49.160 --> 24:50.550
First, I'll tame his killing intent.

24:50.920 --> 24:52.720
Then, I'll teach him the true Heavenly arts

24:52.910 --> 24:53.780
and help him form his Golden Core.

24:54.480 --> 24:55.370
That way, the universe

24:55.510 --> 24:57.000
will have another righteous immortal master.

24:58.720 --> 24:59.980
Taking him as your disciple

25:00.160 --> 25:02.030
will involve the royal family.

25:02.440 --> 25:03.160
Do you

25:03.580 --> 25:04.860
favor Prince Ping?

25:05.310 --> 25:06.000
Of course not.

25:06.400 --> 25:07.850
Prince Ping is ruthless

25:07.880 --> 25:08.590
and quite infamous.

25:09.120 --> 25:10.520
On the contrary, Yu's father,

25:10.540 --> 25:11.210
Prince Zong,

25:11.240 --> 25:12.110
is a kind-hearted

25:12.440 --> 25:14.030
and well-respected prince.

25:14.670 --> 25:16.230
But I don't care about all that.

25:16.680 --> 25:18.480
I felt like taking on a disciple, so I did.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.070
But this could be troublesome.

25:21.590 --> 25:23.680
A few days ago, I had your fortune read.

25:24.000 --> 25:24.640
The reading showed

25:24.960 --> 25:25.880
a rising sun,

25:26.350 --> 25:28.310
but suddenly, dark clouds covered it.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.310
Qingge,

25:30.750 --> 25:32.790
now that your cultivation is complete,

25:33.340 --> 25:34.340
you should follow the will of heaven

25:34.680 --> 25:35.590
and ascend as soon as possible.

25:36.030 --> 25:37.400
Taking Su Yishui as your disciple

25:37.590 --> 25:39.400
might bring you trouble.

25:41.090 --> 25:42.430
Thank you for the warning.

25:42.880 --> 25:44.090
But even if there is trouble,

25:44.270 --> 25:45.550
I'll face it as it comes.

25:46.270 --> 25:47.370
Ascension

25:48.000 --> 25:49.960
sounds so lonely.

25:50.650 --> 25:51.610
The immortals up there

25:51.720 --> 25:52.720
must be so bored.

25:53.240 --> 25:55.110
I prefer to live freely in the mortal world.

25:55.400 --> 25:56.480
Eating, drinking, playing,

25:57.110 --> 25:58.880
and having a rebellious disciple to train.

25:59.350 --> 26:00.150
How interesting!

26:04.350 --> 26:05.900
There are people I care about in the mortal world.

26:07.180 --> 26:08.350
I can't bear to leave them.

26:09.070 --> 26:09.830
Caring for others

26:11.340 --> 26:12.650
sometimes becomes a burden.

26:15.960 --> 26:17.710
If Su Yishui can't be changed,

26:17.880 --> 26:18.440
what will you

26:18.590 --> 26:19.550
do to him?

26:21.270 --> 26:22.710
I'll have no choice

26:22.880 --> 26:23.750
but to kill him myself.

26:24.680 --> 26:25.850
I'm afraid you can't bring yourself

26:25.880 --> 26:26.440
to do that.

26:26.680 --> 26:28.400
You're always protective of those close to you.

26:28.680 --> 26:29.350
You like

26:29.510 --> 26:31.160
to take everyone under your protection.

26:31.750 --> 26:32.640
But you need to understand that

26:33.200 --> 26:33.920
everyone has their own fate.

26:34.350 --> 26:35.030
Sometimes,

26:35.480 --> 26:36.440
you can save a person

26:37.030 --> 26:38.030
but can't change their fate.

26:38.830 --> 26:40.310
Don't let yourself get caught up in it.

26:41.030 --> 26:41.790
I won't.

26:42.510 --> 26:43.160
Never mind.

26:43.480 --> 26:44.160
I know,

26:44.650 --> 26:45.220
sometimes

26:45.240 --> 26:46.610
there's no convincing you.

26:47.680 --> 26:49.480
I've been living here for so long.

26:49.790 --> 26:50.630
I'm getting tired.

26:50.960 --> 26:52.830
It's time to go out.

26:54.680 --> 26:55.510
Where are you going?

26:56.070 --> 26:56.830
Just wander around

26:57.830 --> 26:58.580
and see

26:58.720 --> 27:00.720
the interesting mortal world you mentioned.

27:40.440 --> 27:41.310
Your power has greatly improved.

27:41.510 --> 27:42.850
Hurry up and meditate to channel it.

27:56.680 --> 27:58.280
Direct your power to the acupoints Bing Fen,

27:58.380 --> 27:58.980
Xia Bai,

27:59.150 --> 28:00.180
and Yao Yu.

28:06.310 --> 28:06.980
What are you waiting for?

28:07.270 --> 28:08.060
Do as I say.

28:25.420 --> 28:27.150
When did you leave sword energy in my body?

28:30.640 --> 28:31.640
Your sword moves are too direct.

28:38.110 --> 28:38.780
Focus.

28:44.480 --> 28:45.510
The qin melody is the melody of the heart.

28:46.220 --> 28:47.290
Align your spiritual power

28:47.440 --> 28:48.830
with the rhythm of "Drunk Breeze."

28:53.440 --> 28:54.070
Concentrate your power.

29:14.550 --> 29:15.030
Alright.

29:15.510 --> 29:16.720
Your power has solidified.

29:16.880 --> 29:18.400
You've passed the final test.

29:18.870 --> 29:19.610
When it's time,

29:19.640 --> 29:20.550
you can form your Golden Core.

29:24.240 --> 29:25.640
So, you previously punished me to...

29:28.400 --> 29:29.310
The punishment isn't over yet.

29:29.980 --> 29:30.740
Have a rest.

29:31.160 --> 29:32.310
There's more to come tomorrow.

29:53.730 --> 29:54.250
Father.

29:56.270 --> 29:57.590
It's been so long.

29:58.590 --> 29:59.770
If I hadn't

29:59.800 --> 30:01.920
activated the Spirit Spring in your body,

30:02.350 --> 30:03.200
you probably

30:03.980 --> 30:06.260
wouldn't have come down the mountain to see me.

30:07.400 --> 30:08.030
I didn't know

30:08.030 --> 30:09.160
about your arrival.

30:11.110 --> 30:12.030
Is that so?

30:18.110 --> 30:18.830
Don't forget.

30:19.960 --> 30:20.970
With the Spirit Spring

30:21.000 --> 30:22.410
I injected into your body,

30:22.440 --> 30:23.550
I can control you.

30:24.270 --> 30:25.640
This Heavenly Bottle

30:26.270 --> 30:28.230
is the container of the Spirit Spring.

30:28.860 --> 30:30.890
With just a slight shake,

30:30.920 --> 30:33.240
I can stir the Spirit Spring inside you,

30:33.260 --> 30:34.540
causing you unbearable pain.

30:35.350 --> 30:36.110
So,

30:37.270 --> 30:39.070
don't try to play tricks on me.

30:40.720 --> 30:41.440
I wouldn't dare.

30:45.130 --> 30:46.190
Do you know

30:46.220 --> 30:47.300
by switching to Wester Sect,

30:48.070 --> 30:49.350
you've exposed your identity?

30:50.550 --> 30:52.470
The Eternals have been asking me

30:52.500 --> 30:54.410
why I messed with the Heavenly Sects.

30:56.440 --> 30:56.920
I know.

30:57.110 --> 30:58.640
Then why did you go to Mount Wester?

30:59.000 --> 31:00.280
Mu Qingge has a fondness for pretty boys.

31:00.300 --> 31:00.910
Don't tell me

31:01.680 --> 31:03.110
you've been charmed by her.

31:05.240 --> 31:06.550
I want to kill her every day,

31:07.270 --> 31:08.260
but she tricked me

31:08.290 --> 31:09.010
into taking a soul oath

31:09.310 --> 31:10.350
and put me under her thumb.

31:10.960 --> 31:11.750
What?

31:17.360 --> 31:18.800
You really took a soul oath?

31:21.830 --> 31:22.990
I thought

31:23.010 --> 31:24.590
you were clever and cautious,

31:24.610 --> 31:25.830
but it turns out you're an idiot!

31:26.000 --> 31:27.480
I should've killed you when I had the chance!

31:30.820 --> 31:31.550
Father, calm down.

31:32.100 --> 31:33.210
I've come up with a plan.

31:46.680 --> 31:47.160
What?

31:47.970 --> 31:49.130
You're about to form your core?

31:50.400 --> 31:51.660
Mu Qingge entered Mount Eternal

31:51.720 --> 31:52.690
as if she owned that place.

31:52.920 --> 31:54.310
After I learn her skills,

31:54.480 --> 31:55.440
taking the demonic magic from Eternal Sect

31:55.670 --> 31:56.470
will be a piece of cake.

32:02.000 --> 32:02.640
Alright.

32:03.350 --> 32:04.300
But remember this:

32:04.750 --> 32:06.480
even though you took a soul oath

32:06.500 --> 32:07.320
for Mu Qingge,

32:07.350 --> 32:08.350
your life

32:09.270 --> 32:10.750
is still in my hands.

32:25.110 --> 32:26.350
Why did you bring me to the town?

32:27.440 --> 32:28.650
You'll find out soon.

32:34.400 --> 32:35.570
Thank you, Immortal Master.

32:36.160 --> 32:36.920
You're welcome.

32:38.590 --> 32:39.200
Thank you, Immortal Master,

32:39.440 --> 32:40.370
for saving my wife.

32:40.590 --> 32:41.520
No trouble at all.

32:41.550 --> 32:42.270
Thank you.

32:43.830 --> 32:45.340
Thank you for finding my son.

32:45.750 --> 32:46.510
Thank you.

32:47.110 --> 32:47.830
You're welcome.

32:48.350 --> 32:49.270
Thank you, Immortal Master.

32:51.640 --> 32:52.480
Thank you

32:52.480 --> 32:54.070
for fishing out my donkey from the river.

32:54.510 --> 32:55.460
Thank you, Immortal Master.

32:56.000 --> 32:56.720
You're welcome.

32:58.790 --> 32:59.350
Mu Qingge,

33:00.070 --> 33:01.310
you're actually making money off of me.

33:02.160 --> 33:02.800
Calm down.

33:03.150 --> 33:04.470
There's still a big deal to close.

33:07.530 --> 33:10.040
[Dongxi Village]

33:09.090 --> 33:10.220
You're not trying to make money.

33:10.630 --> 33:11.630
You're helping people, right?

33:13.000 --> 33:14.030
Can't fool you, huh?

33:15.480 --> 33:16.420
There are countless people

33:16.480 --> 33:18.030
in this universe who need help.

33:18.890 --> 33:20.260
These small acts of kindness

33:20.640 --> 33:21.440
are meaningless.

33:22.510 --> 33:24.030
I'll just help as many people as I can.

33:24.400 --> 33:25.510
It's better than doing nothing at all.

33:26.200 --> 33:26.790
Besides,

33:27.270 --> 33:28.740
I can make some money from it, can't I?

33:31.750 --> 33:32.310
What?

33:34.070 --> 33:35.110
You're helping people,

33:35.510 --> 33:36.880
but why do the Heavenly Ones call you a demoness?

33:39.030 --> 33:40.030
Those old fools

33:40.640 --> 33:41.890
only know to cultivate with long faces.

33:41.950 --> 33:43.030
They call anything

33:43.060 --> 33:44.060
that's not their way evil.

33:44.550 --> 33:45.360
I follow my own path.

33:45.590 --> 33:46.200
Who cares about them?

33:46.600 --> 33:47.010
Let's go.

34:00.380 --> 34:01.000
Save them.

34:10.960 --> 34:12.000
Thank you.

34:13.150 --> 34:13.850
How strange.

34:13.920 --> 34:14.600
We were inexplicably

34:14.630 --> 34:15.670
tied to the pillars.

34:15.880 --> 34:16.550
Yeah.

34:19.070 --> 34:19.550
Shui,

34:19.870 --> 34:20.780
there's a child over there.

34:23.000 --> 34:24.510
Always finish what you start.

34:24.800 --> 34:25.300
Hurry up.

34:38.920 --> 34:39.480
Don't be afraid.

34:39.929 --> 34:40.639
Do you know

34:40.670 --> 34:41.630
who hung you up?

34:41.710 --> 34:42.710
No.

34:47.110 --> 34:48.510
This is for you two.

34:52.920 --> 34:54.000
Thank you.

34:54.710 --> 34:55.710
Mind your own business.

34:59.550 --> 35:00.320
What's going on?

35:03.110 --> 35:04.280
The boy who took the girl away

35:04.280 --> 35:05.230
should be an Earth Immortal.

35:05.630 --> 35:06.960
He cast the Shadow Spell on us.

35:07.360 --> 35:08.710
That's why we move in unison.

35:12.870 --> 35:13.700
You helped others

35:13.910 --> 35:15.430
but ended up in trouble.

35:15.580 --> 35:16.310
How laughable!

35:17.710 --> 35:18.930
Isn't this fun?

35:19.110 --> 35:20.710
Just seal that Earth Immortal back into the ground

35:20.970 --> 35:22.410
and save the girl.

35:22.800 --> 35:23.620
Fun, huh?

35:23.840 --> 35:24.480
Alright.

35:25.760 --> 35:26.850
Don't make big moves.

35:26.880 --> 35:27.730
Did you say it's fun?

35:41.030 --> 35:42.070
As an Earth Immortal,

35:42.400 --> 35:43.710
instead of guarding your land,

35:43.780 --> 35:44.630
you're here harming people.

35:45.110 --> 35:46.110
You can't escape.

35:46.880 --> 35:47.820
Break the Shadow Spell.

35:48.190 --> 35:49.150
You two

35:48.350 --> 35:50.320
[Earth Immortal]

35:49.590 --> 35:50.670
are on my turf now.

35:50.960 --> 35:51.840
You'd better behave!

35:58.680 --> 36:02.860
[Sealed Domain]

36:06.300 --> 36:06.970
This is...

36:11.760 --> 36:13.170
The Shadow Spell no longer works.

36:13.850 --> 36:14.600
It seems

36:14.630 --> 36:16.070
we've been pulled into his Sealed Domain.

36:16.840 --> 36:17.880
You know quite a bit, huh?

36:18.420 --> 36:19.560
I've been trapped here for thousands of years,

36:19.590 --> 36:20.400
guarding this land.

36:20.670 --> 36:21.400
It's so boring.

36:21.810 --> 36:22.810
I finally found a chance to sneak out

36:22.840 --> 36:23.880
and look for a playmate,

36:24.480 --> 36:25.590
but you two messed things up.

36:26.240 --> 36:27.490
You'll just stay here forever!

36:34.110 --> 36:34.960
You're dead!

36:43.070 --> 36:44.150
Celestial Ice Thorn?

36:44.480 --> 36:45.710
You really showed no mercy.

36:50.120 --> 36:51.370
This is a small place.

36:51.800 --> 36:52.630
You can't escape.

36:54.440 --> 36:55.080
Let us out.

36:55.190 --> 36:55.920
You want to get out?

36:56.360 --> 36:57.000
No problem.

36:57.550 --> 36:58.840
But every inch of this Sealed Domain

36:59.190 --> 37:00.280
is bound by the celestial contract.

37:00.550 --> 37:01.240
Now that you're here,

37:01.590 --> 37:02.400
you must abide by its rules.

37:02.800 --> 37:03.760
This land of mine

37:04.070 --> 37:05.230
requires two guardians.

37:05.710 --> 37:06.550
The Immortal Realm's negligence

37:06.880 --> 37:08.320
left me here alone for thousands of years.

37:08.510 --> 37:09.850
Now that you three are here,

37:10.030 --> 37:11.190
only two of you can leave.

37:11.500 --> 37:12.210
One must stay.

37:14.630 --> 37:15.360
That's nonsense!

37:16.000 --> 37:16.710
Even if you kill me,

37:17.040 --> 37:17.550
two of you

37:17.580 --> 37:18.620
will still have to stay here.

37:20.320 --> 37:21.030
The exit is over there.

37:21.440 --> 37:22.510
You decide.

37:24.510 --> 37:25.110
Shui.

37:25.590 --> 37:26.280
He's not lying.

37:26.710 --> 37:27.520
The celestial contract here

37:27.540 --> 37:28.770
does indeed restrict us.

37:30.880 --> 37:31.960
But I have an idea.

37:34.280 --> 37:34.990
What is it?

37:43.150 --> 37:43.760
Don't be afraid.

37:44.200 --> 37:45.010
Go back home.

37:49.670 --> 37:50.830
Where's the young lady just now?

37:51.220 --> 37:51.910
She...

37:52.370 --> 37:54.290
She stayed inside by herself.

38:41.590 --> 38:42.280
You're out.

38:42.880 --> 38:43.710
How did you manage that?

38:44.810 --> 38:45.440
I tickled

38:45.460 --> 38:46.730
that Earth Immortal until he couldn't stand it.

38:46.880 --> 38:48.070
Then he admitted that

38:48.090 --> 38:49.310
he opened the portal

38:49.360 --> 38:50.880
with 300 years of cultivation

38:51.280 --> 38:52.400
and came out to mess with people.

38:53.000 --> 38:53.580
So I made him

38:53.600 --> 38:54.810
use another 300 years of cultivation

38:54.840 --> 38:55.890
to open the portal again.

38:56.760 --> 38:57.360
It's not too bad.

38:58.050 --> 38:59.560
I also got a piece of the priceless

38:59.590 --> 39:00.800
Blood Chalcedony as an apology gift.

39:05.480 --> 39:06.880
Were you worried about me?

39:10.280 --> 39:11.110
I was just curious.

39:13.360 --> 39:14.440
I got out

39:14.810 --> 39:16.160
but brought a bit of trouble along with me.

39:17.590 --> 39:18.320
What trouble?

39:19.520 --> 39:20.160
Three.

39:21.000 --> 39:21.630
Two.

39:23.070 --> 39:23.550
One.

39:25.110 --> 39:25.960
The Shadow Spell!

39:27.440 --> 39:28.880
This is the trouble I was talking about.

39:29.700 --> 39:30.850
Once we left the Sealed Domain,

39:31.130 --> 39:32.420
the Shadow Spell took effect again.

39:33.000 --> 39:34.400
How do we break this damn thing?

39:35.480 --> 39:37.210
We can only wait for it to break itself in four hours.

39:38.320 --> 39:38.830
Let's go.

39:39.150 --> 39:40.340
Send the girl back to the village first.

39:40.960 --> 39:42.560
Come on. Hold his sword.

39:50.640 --> 39:52.180
[Hexing Restaurant]

39:59.920 --> 40:00.880
Respect your master.

40:01.110 --> 40:02.000
Let me drink first.

40:02.280 --> 40:03.510
Don't you dote on your disciples?

40:03.920 --> 40:05.110
Why don't you let me eat first?

40:06.430 --> 40:07.130
You won't back down?

40:07.590 --> 40:08.110
Alright.

40:08.550 --> 40:09.960
Let's see how long you can hold out.

40:36.400 --> 40:36.920
They...

40:37.030 --> 40:38.110
A minx and a libertine.

40:39.670 --> 40:40.840
Shameless!

40:40.840 --> 40:41.360
Let's go.

40:42.950 --> 40:44.380
You ruined my image!

40:44.550 --> 40:45.280
You started it first.

40:45.640 --> 40:46.520
And you don't care about

40:46.550 --> 40:47.440
others' opinions anyway.

40:48.400 --> 40:49.510
Calling me a demoness is fine,

40:49.960 --> 40:51.120
but calling me a minx is too much.

40:51.480 --> 40:52.070
Stop it.

40:52.590 --> 40:53.300
It seems

40:53.560 --> 40:55.120
we're embarrassing ourselves more than each other.

40:56.440 --> 40:57.000
Truce.

40:57.790 --> 40:59.110
After we eat, we'll meditate in the inn

40:59.400 --> 41:00.260
until the spell breaks.

41:00.690 --> 41:03.040
[Qingzhu Inn]

41:19.410 --> 41:20.160
Didn't we agree on a truce?

41:20.180 --> 41:20.910
Why are you doing it again?

41:25.230 --> 41:26.670
Hasn't it been four hours already?

41:29.510 --> 41:30.470
You got hurt earlier?

41:33.040 --> 41:33.810
Didn't your defensive aura

41:33.840 --> 41:34.550
block the attack?

41:35.480 --> 41:37.190
Celestial Ice Thorns are pretty powerful.

41:38.320 --> 41:39.250
It's said that

41:39.760 --> 41:40.810
the demoness, Mu Qingge,

41:40.910 --> 41:42.070
has never been injured before.

41:42.760 --> 41:43.480
Then this scar

41:43.760 --> 41:44.670
is the first one?

41:45.400 --> 41:46.960
I was just lucky.

41:47.330 --> 41:48.730
When you help people and seek justice,

41:48.760 --> 41:49.710
it's inevitable to get hurt.

41:50.710 --> 41:51.480
It's just a scar.

41:51.510 --> 41:52.280
No big deal.

41:53.940 --> 41:56.280
♫Ripples shimmer among the flowers♫

41:55.890 --> 41:56.460
Let me do it.

41:56.480 --> 41:59.070
♫The wind plucks the clouds in the sky♫

41:59.440 --> 42:03.390
♫Because of you, my fleeting life is filled with endless thoughts♫

42:04.260 --> 42:07.280
♫Since my lips touched your beauty♫

42:07.630 --> 42:09.890
♫I envy nothing in this world♫

42:10.880 --> 42:14.670
♫Even butterflies and swallows gift us their graceful dance♫

42:14.110 --> 42:14.840
Lower.

42:15.940 --> 42:18.350
♫If the full moon is destined to wane♫

42:18.480 --> 42:21.360
♫If time is bound to change everything♫

42:21.610 --> 42:25.770
♫Then I wish to follow you like a migrating bird♫

42:25.960 --> 42:29.270
♫Never tired of gazing at you, longing for you day and night♫

42:29.290 --> 42:32.260
♫I wish to be with you forever♫

42:32.490 --> 42:36.900
♫Braving every trial and tribulation♫

42:37.180 --> 42:42.190
♫A red thread weaves our fates together♫

42:42.510 --> 42:47.830
♫Every loop and circle is filled with my longing for you♫

42:48.410 --> 42:51.360
♫With love, I fear no winds or storms♫

42:51.490 --> 42:54.730
♫Through all these fleeting years♫

42:55.340 --> 43:02.090
♫You're the best thing that's ever happened to me♫

42:56.920 --> 42:57.920
It's been a busy day.

42:58.230 --> 42:59.230
I'll take a nap.

43:00.000 --> 43:00.440
Shui,

43:00.440 --> 43:01.760
go take a walk in the town by yourself.

43:02.280 --> 43:03.230
Don't disturb me while I sleep.
